# Library packages

Edit the smallest package that owns the behavior. Shared protocol starts in `core`, then `server` and `react` — no duplicate route strings or schemas.

Auth stays in consumer guards. No ORM in `server`. Persistence is `database` (`memoryAdapter()` or `db()` from `@dimah-form/db`), not a plugin. Feature plugins live in their own package; merge once in `dimahForm()`. Throw `APIError` and let the router serialize.

No field widgets in these packages. Custom field types are validators that feed `$Infer`. Optional widgets live in `@dimah-form/ui`.

Responses snapshot the definition they started with. Do not validate old answers against the live questionnaire.

**When adding a package or moving behavior across packages, Read** [docs/agents/architecture.md](docs/agents/architecture.md).

**When changing published API, protocol, endpoints, plugins, or hooks, Read** [docs/agents/packages.md](docs/agents/packages.md).

For a local fix, match the surrounding code.
